Helio — personal app for the Amazfit Helio Strap.

Includes, unmodified unless noted, the modules `strap-protocol` and `strap-science` and parts of the
Android app (local store, Bluetooth link) from Ridge by TheCommishDeuce
(https://github.com/TheCommishDeuce/ridge-helio-strap), licensed GNU AGPL-3.0-or-later
(see LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.txt). Ridge in turn learned the Zepp OS protocol from Gadgetbridge
(AGPL-3.0-or-later). Because of this, Helio as a whole is under the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

Stress curve and Pulse Age follow Pulse Mobile (github.com/adityaongit/pulse-mobile),
PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0: personal, non-commercial use.

The per-second heart-rate log (fetch type 0x57) and the meaning of fetch status 5 follow
OpenStrap's protocol notes (github.com/sayed0am/openstrap, MIT / Apache-2.0).
